---
layout: layouts/staff.njk
staffPage: website
staffTitle: Website
staffHeading: Your <b>website</b>
---
{#- THE MINISTRY'S OWN WEBSITE (0044; mockup canvas "Thauma partner sites").
   Pages, Design, Links, Footer and Settings, one side list like Website in the
   administrators' area, and one Publish bar along the foot.

   Everything here is drawn by staff-site.js from /api/staff-site. Changes
   save as they are made (to the working copy, so nothing is lost between
   visits) and reach visitors only with Publish. Only the ministry's owner,
   and whoever the owner allows, can change anything; everyone else on the
   team sees the same screens, read-only, with "Ask to edit". -#}

<div class="ws-status" id="wsStatus" hidden>
  <button type="button" class="switch" role="switch" id="wsOn" aria-checked="false"
          data-i18n-attr="aria-label:ws.live" aria-label="Live">
    <span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-state">Off</span><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
  </button>
  <div class="ws-where">
    <b id="wsState"></b>
    <span id="wsAddress"></span>
  </div>
  <a class="ghost-btn" id="wsOpen" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="ws.open">Open site ↗</a>
  <a class="ghost-btn" id="wsPreview" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="ws.preview">Preview ↗</a>
</div>

{#- For somebody on the team who is not allowed to edit (Chase, 2026-09-28:
   "Staff can view the site and request edit access"). -#}
<div class="ws-ask" id="wsAsk" hidden>
  <div class="ws-ask-words"><b id="wsAskTitle"></b><span id="wsAskText"></span></div>
  <label class="fld ws-ask-note"><span data-i18n="ws.askNote">A note for them</span>
    <input type="text" id="wsAskNote" maxlength="300"></label>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="wsAskBtn" data-i18n="ws.ask">Ask to edit</button>
</div>

<div class="ws" id="wsRoot" hidden>
  <nav class="ws-side" aria-label="Website">
    <button type="button" class="ws-tab" data-ws-tab="pages" aria-current="page" data-i18n="ws.tab.pages">Pages</button>
    <button type="button" class="ws-tab" data-ws-tab="design" data-i18n="ws.tab.design">Design</button>
    <button type="button" class="ws-tab" data-ws-tab="links" data-i18n="ws.tab.links">Links</button>
    <button type="button" class="ws-tab" data-ws-tab="footer" data-i18n="ws.tab.footer">Footer</button>
    <button type="button" class="ws-tab" data-ws-tab="settings" data-i18n="ws.tab.settings">Settings</button>
  </nav>

  <div class="ws-main">
    {#- The language being written, and one to compare with — the same pair,
        swap and Translate as every other editor. Pages and Links use it. -#}
    <div class="ms-writing ws-writing" id="wsWriting">
      <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.editing">Editing</span>
        <select id="wsLangA" class="lang-pick" data-lang-edit></select></label>
      <span class="lang-ref" id="wsRefWrap">
        <button type="button" class="lang-swap" data-lang-swap data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.swap,title:con.swap" aria-label="Swap" title="Swap">&#8644;</button>
        <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.reference">Reference</span>
          <select id="wsLangB" class="lang-pick" data-lang-ref></select></label>
        <button type="button" class="ghost-btn sm lang-ai" data-lang-translate data-i18n="ai.translate">Translate</button>
      </span>
    </div>

    <section class="ws-panel" data-ws-panel="pages" id="wsPages"></section>
    <section class="ws-panel" data-ws-panel="design" id="wsDesign" hidden></section>
    <section class="ws-panel" data-ws-panel="links" id="wsLinks" hidden></section>
    <section class="ws-panel" data-ws-panel="footer" id="wsFooter" hidden></section>
    <section class="ws-panel" data-ws-panel="settings" id="wsSettings" hidden></section>
  </div>

  {#- The page as it will look, beside whatever is being changed: the real
      site, drawn from the working copy, redrawn after each change — the page
      being arranged on Pages, Home on Design, Links and Footer. -#}
  <aside class="ws-preview" id="wsPreviewPane" hidden>
    <div class="ws-preview-head"><span data-i18n="ws.onSite">On the site</span><span id="wsPreviewPath"></span></div>
    <div class="ws-preview-frame"><iframe id="wsFrame" title="Preview" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
  </aside>
</div>

{#- Adding a section: every kind there is, each drawn as a small sketch. -#}
<div class="dlg-back" id="wsAddBack" hidden>
  <div class="dlg ws-add" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="wsAddTitle">
    <div class="ws-add-head"><h3 id="wsAddTitle"></h3>
      <button type="button" class="sw-close" id="wsAddClose" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:common.close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button></div>
    <div class="ws-tiles" id="wsTiles"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ms-savebar ws-bar" id="wsBar" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
  <span class="ms-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span id="wsBarText" data-i18n="ws.unpublished">Changes not published yet</span>
  <span class="ws-saved" id="wsSaved"></span>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wsDiscard" data-i18n="ms.discard">Discard</button>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="wsPublish" data-i18n="up.publish">Publish</button>
</div>
